    <data key="d0">Met Office Severe Weather Warning Dissemination Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D_4dsXVqzMs</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless architecture using Step Functions, Lambda, and S3 to disseminate severe weather warnings under 1-2 minutes at 5% of previous on-premise operating costs.</data>
    <data key="d3">Serverless Weather Alerts Dissemination</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
